@guide A_Terokkar
@name Terokkar Forest (Allerian Stronghold)
@faction Alliance
@levels 63-65
@zone Terokkar Forest
@chapter Outland
@desc Shattrath City (choose Aldor or Scryers), Allerian Stronghold, Cenarion Thicket, Firewing Point, the Bone Wastes and Skettis' edge.
@next A_Nagrand

accept A'dal [optional] | Khadgar's servant brings you to A'dal in Shattrath (opens the Aldor/Scryer choice).
turnin A'dal [optional] | Turned in at Shattrath City.
fp Shattrath City
note In Shattrath, pick the Aldor or the Scryers. Either is fine for leveling; it only affects later rewards.
fp Allerian Stronghold
accept Unruly Neighbors | Bertelm.
accept Timber Worg Tails
accept Thin the Flock | Lieutenant Gravelhammer, Allerian Stronghold.
accept Speak with Private Weeks
accept Olemba Seeds | Ros'eleth.
accept Wanted: Bonelashers Dead!
accept Stymying the Arakkoa | Thander.
accept Magical Disturbances | Andarl.
bind Allerian Stronghold
turnin Speak with Private Weeks | Private Weeks, Shadow Council camp area.
accept Who Are They?
complete Who Are They? | Use the disguise at the Shadow Council camp.
turnin Who Are They?
accept Kill the Shadow Council!
complete Thin the Flock | Arakkoa at Veil Rhaze area.
complete Unruly Neighbors | Firewing blood elves around Firewing Point.
complete Timber Worg Tails | Timber Worgs.
complete Olemba Seeds | Olemba cones from the trees.
turnin Olemba Seeds
accept Vessels of Power
turnin Thin the Flock
complete Kill the Shadow Council!
turnin Kill the Shadow Council!
turnin Timber Worg Tails
accept The Elusive Ironjaw
complete Magical Disturbances | Mana Wraiths at the Bone Wastes.
complete Stymying the Arakkoa | Arakkoa at the eastern veils.
turnin Magical Disturbances
complete The Elusive Ironjaw | Ironjaw's Pelt drops from Ironjaw.
complete Vessels of Power | Draenei Vessel: loot Draenei Vessel.
complete Wanted: Bonelashers Dead!
turnin Wanted: Bonelashers Dead!
accept Strange Energy
accept Clues in the Thicket
complete Strange Energy | Teromoth Sample drops from Teromoth. Vicious Teromoth Sample drops from Vicious Teromoth.
complete Clues in the Thicket | Click Strange Object.
turnin Strange Energy
turnin Clues in the Thicket
accept By Any Means Necessary
turnin By Any Means Necessary
accept Wind Trader Lathrai
turnin Wind Trader Lathrai | Lower City, Shattrath.
accept A Personal Favor
complete A Personal Favor | Lathrai's Stolen Goods drops from Skithian Dreadhawk and Skithian Windripper.
turnin A Personal Favor | Turned in at Shattrath City.
accept Investigate Tuurem
turnin Investigate Tuurem
accept What Are These Things?
turnin What Are These Things?
accept Report to the Allerian Post
turnin Unruly Neighbors
accept The Firewing Liaison
accept Thinning the Ranks
complete The Firewing Liaison
complete Thinning the Ranks
turnin Report to the Allerian Post
accept Attack on Firewing Point
complete Attack on Firewing Point
turnin Attack on Firewing Point
accept The Final Code
turnin The Firewing Liaison
turnin Thinning the Ranks
turnin The Elusive Ironjaw
turnin Vessels of Power
turnin Stymying the Arakkoa
complete The Final Code | Click Mana Bomb.
turnin The Final Code
accept Letting Earthbinder Tavgren Know
accept 9961 What's Wrong at Cenarion Thicket? | Jenai Starwhisper.
turnin 9961 What's Wrong at Cenarion Thicket? | Earthbinder Tavgren, Cenarion Thicket (north).
turnin Letting Earthbinder Tavgren Know
accept Digging Through Bones | Chief Archaeologist Letoll, Bone Wastes.
accept An Improper Burial | Commander Ra'vaj, Sha'tari Base Camp (southwest).
complete An Improper Burial
turnin An Improper Burial
accept A Hero Is Needed
complete A Hero Is Needed
turnin A Hero Is Needed
accept The Fallen Exarch
complete The Fallen Exarch
turnin The Fallen Exarch
complete Digging Through Bones [group=2] | Escort.
turnin Digging Through Bones
accept For the Fallen | Vindicator Haylen.
complete For the Fallen
turnin For the Fallen
accept Terokkarantula | Group quest: Terokkarantula is elite.
complete Terokkarantula [group=2] | Elite: Terokkarantula; bring help or skip.
turnin Terokkarantula
level 65
note Ride west from Shattrath into Nagrand; Telaar is the Alliance town in the south.
